<title>USA: NN Ball &amp; Roller to open plant in Ireland.</title>
<headline>NN Ball &amp; Roller to open plant in Ireland.</headline>
<dateline>ERWIN, Tenn. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>NN Ball &amp; Roller Inc said Thursday it plans to open a manufacturing plant in Ireland, which will be the company's first manufacturing facility outside the United States.</p>
<p>The company said international expansion is critical to its growth.</p>
<p>The company said it is acquiring an existing building and said it anticipates beginning production in the third quarter of this year.</p>
</text>
